   <taskbody>
      <steps>
         <step>
            <cmd>You must <xref href="#deleteactionlicensewsep">update the License Webservice Endpoint</xref>.</cmd>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>After updating the License Webservice Endpoint, you must <xref href="../installing_x_author_for_excel_98667656/installing_xauthor_for_excel.dita">refresh your licenses</xref>.</cmd>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>The last step is to refresh your local license files. X-Author refreshes the local license files every 24 hours. <xref href="#deleteactionlocallicense">Refresh your local license files</xref> to enable and use the Delete action.</cmd>
